Place the downloaded "Troops / detection" dataset here (YOLOv11 detection
format, including its data.yaml) -- see the README's "Get the training
data" section for the download link. train.py expects
dataset/troops/data.yaml to exist as the detection dataset config.

This file itself is just a placeholder so the folder exists on a fresh
clone -- delete it once real dataset content is here (or leave it, it's
harmless).
